  m_text: "As the village leader, your primary duty is survival. Every day is a race
    against time to hunt, forage, and secure enough scarce food to feed your starving
    community. \n\nThe wilderness is brutal, but with dedication and careful resource
    management, you can upgrade your tools and build sturdier housing to help your
    village grow.\n\nReturn empty-handed, and you will be forced to make choices
    no leader should ever wish to face."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f574284536cc4046907277feb3d294e, type: 2}
